1
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,880
That's why when this guy killed Shen Xian,

2
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,440
Chen Yanzhi had a motive to help.

3
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,840
Chen Yanzhi didn't kill my brother himself.

4
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:54,120
The stab wound incisions on Shen Xian

5
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:55,880
and points of impact show two strikes.

6
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:57,760
Back then, they thought it was two strikes,

7
00:00:58,120 --> 00:00:58,960
but now it seems

8
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:00,520
it was done by two different people.

9
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:02,920
The serial killer's profile back then

10
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,280
indicated someone physically weak

11
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:05,640
and young.

12
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:08,760
Still, he must've dealt the fatal blows.

13
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,480
Chen Yanzhi did the follow-up stabbing

14
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:12,400
to mislead the police.

15
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:15,200
Back then, my mother

16
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:17,480
was killed the exact same way.

17
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:20,640
Chen Yanzhi's misdirection

18
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:23,040
kept the killer hidden all these years.

19
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:26,400
13 years ago, he was just a teenager,

20
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:27,920
while Chen Yanzhi

21
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:29,560
was at least 30 years older than him.

22
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,200
Just what kind of feelings

23
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:32,120
did he actually have for Chen Yanzhi?

24
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:34,920
He was just using him.

25
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:38,120
He used Chen Yanzhi over and over again

26
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,320
to carry out the murders.

27
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:41,920
It fits right into his pattern

28
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:43,760
of using others to eliminate obstacles.

29
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,920
Rather than striking back at us,

30
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:47,400
it's more like

31
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,400
he wants to use our hands

32
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,640
to get rid of Chen Yanzhi.

33
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:53,680
It matches the Shen family's cold nature.

34
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,480
I went to the Shen family

35
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:00,280
and looked into that child from back then,

36
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,400
but there wasn't a single lead.

37
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,480
The Li family refuses to admit

38
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,560
such a child ever existed.

39
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:08,600
Even showing his photo with Chen Yanzhi,

40
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:10,280
it was useless.

41
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:12,400
With my dad's methods,

42
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,560
hiding a child back then

43
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,720
would've been effortless.

44
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:18,360
Now that a murder case is involved,

45
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:20,000
there's no way he'll ever acknowledge

46
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,080
that child's identity.

47
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:24,280
He's already a victim in the true sense,

48
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:26,560
living under a new identity now.

49
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:29,120
At age 23 to 28,

50
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,440
he might still be in school,

51
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:32,280
or he might have graduated.

52
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:34,560
Even you couldn't find anything?

53
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,720
Concrete evidence takes time.

54
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:38,160
Just wait a little longer.

55
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:39,560
What about the motive?

56
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,440
Why did he kill Shen Xian back then?

57
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:43,560
Jealousy.

58
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,360
Both were illegitimate sons,

59
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,080
yet Shen Xian got to live

60
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,120
in the Shen family's ancestral home,

61
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,280
while he

62
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:51,280
was never acknowledged.

63
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:53,560
However, inciting others to commit crimes

64
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,680
has now proven

65
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:58,000
that a swift death doesn't satisfy him,

66
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:00,800
but psychological and mental torment does.

67
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:02,880
Zhang Dafeng's attack...

68
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:47,360
The setup in Li Changyu's case.

69
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,280
Thanks for your hard work today.

70
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:51,960
Let me walk you out.

71
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:53,280
All right, sir.

72
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:57,360
When I went there this afternoon,

73
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:59,320
I saw Ma'am go from the living room to the bedroom.

74
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:01,280
Sir. Ma'am.

75
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,560
I'm here.

76
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:05,600
The probing in He Shuyi's case.

77
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:16,160
Most of the probing was between us.

78
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,160
He wanted to plunge me

79
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,720
into the pain of losing my true love.

80
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,480
From the moment of my car crash,

81
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:26,360
he'd already targeted me.

82
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:28,600
And also because

83
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:30,840
you're by my side.

84
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:57,720
It's okay now.

85
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,600
I'll always be right by your side.

86
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,000
He's right here in Ancheng.

87
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:14,920
Right around us.

88
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,560
If the media keeps releasing updates,

89
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:18,040
we can definitely flush him out.

90
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,040
All right.

91
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,040
According to current developments,

92
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:22,560
a murder case buried for 13 years

93
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,360
has resurfaced.

94
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:25,160
The suspect is about to be caught.

95
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:30,000
Excuse me!

96
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,800
Welcome to the afternoon film screening!

97
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,040
Oh, it's you.

98
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:44,720
What are you doing here?

99
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:47,240
Instead of earning money at the cafe,

100
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:49,360
why did you come to a campus club

101
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:50,360
to do volunteer work?

102
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:52,800
The club is holding an event.

103
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:54,920
Handing out flyers pays 200 an hour.

104
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,920
Are you only handing out flyers here?

105
00:05:58,720 --> 00:05:59,240
Yeah.

106
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:00,040
That's right.

107
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:01,920
Though...

108
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,840
it seems you've lost your sister.

109
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:14,720
Hey!

110
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,000
Excuse me!

111
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:22,040
There's a film screening this afternoon.

112
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,280
Here.

113
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:28,120
He's here.

114
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,240
Thank you.

115
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:43,040
Here's a souvenir from the event.

116
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,120
It's edible.

117
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,120
A volunteer will help you to your seat.

118
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,120
Sure, thanks.

119
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:49,600
Hello, miss.

120
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:51,240
Would you like to sit in a regular seat,

121
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,560
or stay in your wheelchair?

122
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,120
A regular seat is fine.

123
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,600
I don't want to block anyone's view.

124
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:57,160
Sure.

125
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:58,480
Thanks a lot.

126
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,560
I know you're in the second row,

127
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:41,160
right in the center section,

128
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:42,600
in seat 15.

129
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:44,240
Where are you?

130
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,360
It's pitch-black inside the theater.

131
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:48,160
If someone pulls out a phone,

132
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,040
the light is bound to draw

133
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:51,040
everyone else's attention.

134
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:30,440
Don't move.
